  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design a Monitoring and Evaluation System for CAFOD Sierra Leone &amp; Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this consultancy aims at enabling CAFOD to set up an M&amp;E system to regularly and systematically track its contribution to policy influence and monitor its progress towards the attainment of its strategic goals and its Strategic Plan, thus enhancing accountability and credibility. The purpose is the establishment of an operational monitoring and evaluation system for her programmes in order to effectively monitor project progress and achievement</narrative>
  </description>
